{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <strong>Don\u2019t let the unknown weigh you down, but let it push you forward, no matter where the path leads. Worlds are separated by mystical corridors, and the only way to discover what is on the other side is to step through.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/8245e667b0585926267246e7b1e5c678.poster.avif?t=1774602702\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/8245e667b0585926267246e7b1e5c678.webm?t=1774602702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/8245e667b0585926267246e7b1e5c678.mp4?t=1774602702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>As you wander, you can find different items such as main weapons, sub weapons, relics and outfits. With the items in your possession, you can build your own loadout to fit your style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/047ec89640a8f3bb95f306fa4228aee1.poster.avif?t=1774602702\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/047ec89640a8f3bb95f306fa4228aee1.webm?t=1774602702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/047ec89640a8f3bb95f306fa4228aee1.mp